"""Validate final Rune hub review and produce interactive before/after views."""
import json
from pathlib import Path
from hub import OUT as ROOT_OUT,scan
OUT=ROOT_OUT/'open-centers';r=json.loads((OUT/'verification.json').read_text());proof=json.loads((OUT/'geometry-verification.json').read_text());renders=json.loads((OUT/'renders.json').read_text())
assert len(renders['views'])==24
for row in renders['views']:assert scan.digest(Path(row['path']))==row['sha256']
for path,h in r['input_pins'].items():assert scan.digest(Path(path))==h
assert scan.digest(Path(r['candidate_collision']))==r['candidate_sha256']
paths={bank:{scope:{view:{stage:str(OUT/f'{bank}-{scope}-{view}-{stage}.webp')for stage in ['source','candidate']}for view in ['oblique','face','reverse']}for scope in ['housings','hub-context']}for bank in ['bank-a','bank-b']}
html='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>
body{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--foreground)}p{margin:0 0 12px}.controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0}select{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--background);padding:7px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);max-width:100%}.images{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}figure{margin:0}figcaption{margin-bottom:6px}img{width:100%;display:block;border-radius:var(--radius)}.muted{color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:13px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:13px}th,td{text-align:left;padding:8px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.note{padding:16px;background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);margin:14px 0}</style></head><body>
<p><strong>Next: Power Rune fixed hub housings.</strong><br>Four detailed owners become 12 convex shapes. The center openings stay clear; all moving arms and the complete visual Rune remain unchanged.</p>
<div class="controls"><select id="bank" aria-label="Bank"><option value="bank-a">Bank A</option><option value="bank-b">Bank B</option></select><select id="scope" aria-label="Scope"><option value="housings">Changed housings only</option><option value="hub-context">Fixed hub context</option></select><select id="camera" aria-label="Camera"><option value="oblique">Oblique</option><option value="face">Face</option><option value="reverse">Reverse</option></select></div>
<div class="images"><figure><figcaption>Previous collision</figcaption><img id="before" alt="Detailed fixed hub housings"></figure><figure><figcaption>Convex sections, open centers</figcaption><img id="after" alt="Simplified hub housings retaining center openings"></figure></div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Blue: selected source collision. Orange: replacement shapes. Grey: unchanged fixed hub context. Moving arms are hidden in these isolated views.</p>
<table><tr><th>Both banks combined</th><th>Before</th><th>Proposal</th></tr><tr><td>Changed owners</td><td>4,157 mesh triangles</td><td>12 hulls</td></tr><tr><td>Rune remaining mesh</td><td>112,658</td><td>108,501 + hulls</td></tr><tr><td>Rune diagnostic mesh</td><td>112,658</td><td>109,201</td></tr></table>
<div class="note"><strong>Keep the center exposure and rotating space.</strong> All 270 moving-arm meshes remain exact. The enclosing fits have no arm intrusion witnesses at 24 sampled angles; the final sections stay inside those fits. All 4,000 two-sided center-disk rays still hit the same disk first, with no advance over 2 mm.</div>
<p>The housings lose channels and recesses; sampled new-surface distance to source reaches about 35.9 mm. Five convex sections around each center opening avoid a solid cap over the disk.</p>
<p>The two large bracket hulls were rejected after the arm-sweep check. A simpler four-hull version also failed because it blocked the center disks. Those large brackets remain unchanged in this proposal.</p>
<p class="muted">Whole-map native proposal: 400,500 mesh triangles + 80 cylinders, 8 boxes, 32 hulls. Visual triangles remain 344,792. These are finite geometry screens; continuous clearance, gameplay behavior and runtime speedup remain unverified. Native mixed-shape loading is still outstanding. Nothing installed or committed.</p>
<script>const paths=PATHS;function update(){const p=paths[bank.value][scope.value][camera.value];before.src=p.source;after.src=p.candidate;}for(const id of ['bank','scope','camera'])document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('change',update);update();console.log('Rune fixed hub proposal: 24 matched images');</script></body></html>'''.replace('PATHS',json.dumps(paths))
(OUT/'gallery.html').write_text(html)
hashes={str(p.relative_to(OUT)):scan.digest(p)for p in OUT.rglob('*')if p.is_file()and p.name not in ['gallery.html','final-verification.json']}
(OUT/'final-verification.json').write_text(json.dumps(dict(geometry=proof,matched_images=24,artifact_sha256=hashes,installed=False),indent=2)+'\n');print('Verified final proposal, input hashes and 24 matched images.')
